### Symbio Basic (Current)
Symbio Basic is a clean, open-source version of Symbio, stripped of all
proprietary APIs, personal names, and private credentials. It is designed
for anyone to use with their own AI gateway and configuration.

- **Zyra Exe** — Creator & Visionary
